/bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/article/10925405\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e【V2.2攻略】#邀约事件#早柚，托马邀约简明攻略【导图】\u003c/a\u003e  作者：\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/accountCenter/postList?id=232866066\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(102,102,102,1)\\\"\u003eDramaturge\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd1 热闹的课堂\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/dc0e5ab4426286a8881770ab319cc894_1301879603832556069.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e不管是谁，都要好好听讲哦。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 独处的时光\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/88c756ffe7b681c947ece30d9a8bd797_4777146053381011651.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e织毛衣，比想象中的还要困难呢。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 寄托思念的海风\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/6cd85cc26f6cef606a5834f5850d0587_5081086363419442877.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e唯有陪伴，能够缓解孤独与悲伤。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd4 新衣服！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/fcf242c654c3e2f39499e0ad7da7ce85_4848294368328507434.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e托马为流浪猫狗织的毛衣，不过有一件似乎不太合适？\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd5 手有余香\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/aaa14ae94667d32d2e1dceb6baf4aa5a_4569164046525559018.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e希望这枚御守，可以给你带来更多的好运。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd6 家政官的另一面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/28/1694811/30119389fb3fc9c25dbd83baa779d2ad_3817357936052474784.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「果然，还是做家政轻松有趣。」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1372","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"攻略方法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1373","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1702959533","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"95","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_gr